  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/MussesTales1711.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;Associaci&oacute; Musical Talense ha celebrat el cap de setmana del 25 i 26 de novembre la festa de Santa Cec&iacute;lia, amb l&#39;elecci&oacute; com a mussa d&#39;Amparo Gonz&aacute;lez Catal&aacute;n, que rellevava a Albina Perteg&aacute;s Fornas, dissabte, i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/SantaCeciliaTales.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>la incorporaci&oacute; diumenge a la banda d&#39;Aitana Badenes Camarasa, Laura Balaguer Miralles, Edurne Maci&aacute;n Garc&iacute;a (flautes), In&eacute;s Miralles Soler (clarinet) i Vicent Ortells Prades (sax&ograve;fon).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incorporacions-xiquets-banda-tales/img_9490.jpg\" alt=\"img_9490\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incorporacions-xiquets-banda-tales/img_9491.jpg\" alt=\"img_9491\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incorporacions-xiquets-banda-tales/img_9492.jpg\" alt=\"img_9492\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incorporacions-xiquets-banda-tales/img_9494.jpg\" alt=\"img_9494\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incorporacions-xiquets-banda-tales/img_9496.jpg\" alt=\"img_9496\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incorporacions-xiquets-banda-tales/img_9499.jpg\" alt=\"img_9499\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev